    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Boqorradii Waqooyi Oo Laga Adkaaday",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markuu boqorkii Xaasoor oo ahaa Yaabiin waxaas maqlay ayuu u cid diray boqorkii Maadoon oo ahaa Yoobaab, iyo boqorkii Akshaaf, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo boqorradii jiray xagga woqooyi, kaas oo ahaa dalka buuraha leh, iyo kuwii joogay xagga ban Caraabaah oo koonfur ka xigta Kinnered, iyo xagga dooxooyinka, iyo dalka sare oo Door ee xagga galbeed jira, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo kuwii reer Kancaan oo jiray bari iyo galbeedba, iyo reer Amor, iyo reer Xeed, iyo reer Feris, iyo reer Yebuus oo degganaa dalka buuraha leh, iyo reer Xiwi oo degganaa dalkii Misfaah oo ka hooseeyey Xermoon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolkaasay baxeen, iyagii iyo ciidammadoodii oo la jirayba, oo waxay ahaayeen dad badan, oo tiradoodu waxay ahayd sida cammuudda taal badda xeebteeda, waxayna wateen fardo iyo gaadhifardood aad u badan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo boqorradaas oo dhammu way isu yimaadeen, oo waxay wada degeen biyihii Meeroom agtooda si ay reer binu Israa'iil ula diriraan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Rabbigu wuxuu Yashuuca ku yidhi, Ha ka cabsan iyaga, waayo, berri hadda oo kale ayaan reer binu Israa'iil gacanta u gelin doonaa, iyagoo la wada laayay. Oo waa inaad fardahooda boqno gooysaa, oo gaadhifardoodkoodana waa inaad dab ku gubtaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasay Yashuuca iyo raggii dagaalyahannada ahaa oo dhammu biyihii Meeroom agtooda kaga soo kediyeen oo weerareen iyagii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Rabbigu wuxuu iyagii geliyey gacantii reer binu Israa'iil, oo way laayeen, oo waxay u eryadeen xagga Siidoonta weyn, iyo xagga Misrefood Mayim, iyo xagga dooxadii Misfaah oo bari xigta, oo way laayeen ilaa aanay waxba ka reebin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Yashuuca wuxuu ku sameeyey iyagii wixii Rabbigu u sheegay; oo fardahoodii wuu boqno gooyay, oo gaadhifardoodkoodiina dab buu ku wada gubay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markaasaa Yashuuca dib u noqday, oo wuxuu qabsaday Xaasoor, oo boqorkeediina wuxuu ku dilay seef; waayo, markaas ka hor Xaasoor madax bay u ahaan jirtay boqortooyooyinkaas oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dadkii ku jiray oo dhan waxay ku laayeen seef, wayna wada baabbi'iyeen; oo wax neefsadaa kuma hadhin, Xaasoorna dab buu ku gubay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Yashuuca wuxuu wada qabsaday boqorradaas magaalooyinkoodii oo dhan, iyo boqorradoodii oo dhan, oo wuxuu ku wada laayay seef, oo wuu wada baabbi'iyey; sidii uu addoonkii Rabbiga oo Muuse ahaa ku amray. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse reer binu Israa'iil waxba kama gubin magaalooyinkii buurahoodii ku yiil, Xaasoor mooyaane, taasna waxaa gubay Yashuuca. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo magaalooyinkaas alaabtoodii oo dhan iyo xoolahoodii oo dhanba reer binu Israa'iil way dhaceen, laakiinse nin kasta waxay ku dileen seef ilaa ay wada baabbi'iyeen, oo waxba kama ay reebin intii neefsatay oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wixii Rabbigu addoonkiisii Muuse ahaa ku amray ayuu Muusena Yashuuca ku amray, oo Yashuucana sidaasuu yeelay, oo kulli wixii Rabbigu Muuse ku amray wax aanu samayn ma jirin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Yashuuca wuxuu qabsaday dalkaas oo dhan, kaas oo ahaa dalkii buuraha lahaa, iyo Koonfur oo dhan, iyo dalkii Goshen oo dhan, iyo dalkii dooxada ahaa, iyo bankii Caraabaah, iyo dalkii reer binu Israa'iil oo buuraha lahaa, iyo intiisii dooxada ahayd, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "haddii laga bilaabo Buur Haalaaq, taasoo kor u kacsan ilaa Seciir, iyo xataa tan iyo Bacal Gaad oo ku taal dooxadii Lubnaan oo ka hoosaysa Buur Xermoon; oo wuxuu wada qabsaday boqorradoodii oo dhan, oo intuu dilay buu wada laayay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Yashuuca wakhti dheer buu la dirirayay boqorradaas oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo lama arag magaalo la nabadday reer binu Israa'iil, reer Xiwi oo Gibecoon degganaa mooyaane: oo dagaal bay kulligood ku wada qabsadeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, xagga Rabbiga ayay ka timid inuu qalbigooda adkeeyo, si ay dagaal ugu soo baxaan reer binu Israa'iil, oo uu dhammaantood u baabbi'iyo, oo aanay waxba inna raallinimo ka helin, laakiinse uu u wada baabbi'iyo sidii Rabbigu Muuse ku amray.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markaasaa Yashuuca yimid, oo wuxuu reer Canaaq ka tiray dalkii buuraha lahaa, kaas oo ahaa Xebroon, iyo Debiir, iyo Canaab, iyo xaggii dalkii reer Yahuudah oo buuraha lahaa oo dhan, iyo dalkii reer binu Israa'iil oo buuraha lahaa oo dhan; oo Yashuuca dhammaan iyagii iyo magaalooyinkoodiiba wuu wada baabbi'iyey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dalkii reer binu Israa'iil mid reer Canaaq ahu kuma hadhin, laakiinse waxaa wuxoogaa ku hadhay Gaasa, iyo Gad, iyo Ashdood oo keliya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaasuu Yashuuca u wada qabsaday dalkii oo dhan, oo wuxuu wada yeelay sidii Rabbigu kula hadlay Muuse; oo Yashuuca wuxuu dalkii dhaxal u siiyey reer binu Israa'iil, oo wuxuu ugu qaybiyey sidii qabiilooyinkoodu ahaayeen. Oo dalkiina dagaal wuu ka nastay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
